---
id: 7af9d07c-9b14-4d03-a071-706c569f3764
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant D as Site D<br/>default site
    participant R as Site R<br/>redirect site
    participant CFG as Config<br/>auth entries

    Note over C,CFG: Redirect when Site R already has local credentials
    C->>CFG: Load default hostname and auth entries
    C->>D: POST /api/v1/depositions/new<br/>Bearer Site D access token
    D-->>C: invalid_location<br/>base_url = Site R

    C->>C: Validate Site R URL<br/>allowed domain and HTTPS
    C->>CFG: Lookup auths.site_r
    CFG-->>C: Site R refresh token exists

    C->>R: POST /auth/tokens/refresh<br/>{ refresh_token: Site R refresh token }
    R-->>C: Site R access token<br/>Site R refresh token
    C->>CFG: Store returned tokens under auths.site_r

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/depositions/new<br/>Bearer Site R access token
    R-->>C: dep_id and site URLs
